  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p>2학년 한 반만 들어가서 아낌없는 재료를 투자하여 구리테이프로 우리 반 LED 생일 달력 만들기를 했네요.</p><p>같은 달에 생일 든 학생들끼리 모여서 생일 달력을 만들었습니다.</p><p>학사 달력 만들래? 생일 달력 만들래? 했더니 모두 생일 달력을 만든다고 하네요^^</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9908EB505CBE978323\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20190416_143036.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_9908EB505CBE978323F559\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D923505CBE97851B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20190416_143011.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_99D923505CBE97851B71B4\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9939D5505CBE978621\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"497\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20190416_143016.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"497\"  id=\"A_9939D5505CBE978621195B\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/997CE5505CBE978814\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20190416_143020.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_997CE5505CBE9788141F4B\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B17F505CBE978A1D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20190416_143024.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_99B17F505CBE978A1DB94A\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/997040505CBE978C15\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20190416_143033.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_997040505CBE978C15EEF5\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996EB8505CBE978E1F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20190416_143040.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_996EB8505CBE978E1FAD27\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99BBDB4E5CBE978F1B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"580\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20190416_143044.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"580\"  id=\"A_99BBDB4E5CBE978F1B39E1\"/></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
